      "body": "## Summary\n\nHiCache storage clear and remote weight export endpoints were decorated with `AuthLevel.ADMIN_OPTIONAL`, but unlike HiCache attach/detach they did not reject requests when the server was started without `--admin-api-key`. With only `--api-key` set, a caller holding the user API key could clear hierarchical cache storage or drive remote weight transfer.\n\nThis change matches the existing `_backend_status()` / attach-detach pattern: if `admin_api_key` is unset, return the same missing-admin-key response; otherwise keep requiring an admin token via the decorator.\n\nAlso extends `ADMIN_PATHS` in `test_http_server_auth_levels.py` and asserts that a user API key is rejected on those paths.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/http_server.py`: add admin-key-missing checks to\n  - `/hicache/storage-backend/clear`\n  - `/init_weights_send_group_for_remote_instance`\n  - `/send_weights_to_remote_instance`\n- `test/registered/unit/entrypoints/test_http_server_auth_levels.py`: cover the three paths + reject user token\n\n## How to verify\n\n1. Start server with `--api-key` only (no `--admin-api-key`); calling the three endpoints with the user key should get 400 (admin key required).\n2. Start with both `--api-key` and `--admin-api-key`; user key rejected, admin key allowed.\n3. `python -m pytest test/registered/unit/entrypoints/test_http_server_auth_levels.py -q`\n\n## Related\n\nResolves #44191  \nResolves #44187\n\nSame series as #44230 / #43706 (admin auth on other management endpoints).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38532911098](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38532911098)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38532911109](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38532911109)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38532911107](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38532911107)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
